<title>FRANCE: French election - latest results at 0120 GMT.</title>
<headline>French election - latest results at 0120 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the latest state of the count in the first round of France's election for the 577-seat National Assembly, held on Sunday, according to the French Interior Ministry.</p>
<p>The first table gives the score in the outgoing parliament, seats won on the first round.</p>
<p>The second table gives the number of votes won and the percentage share of the national popular vote.</p>
<p>At the bottom of the tables are the figures for the number of registered voters and the turnout.</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEATS	     outgoing seats    seats won   well placed</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		     0	  0	   0</p>
<p> Communists			24	  1	  30</p>
<p> Socialists			56	  0	 144</p>
<p> PRS*				 5	  0	   6</p>
<p> Other left			 9	  0	   6</p>
<p> Ecologists			 0	  0	   2</p>
<p> Independents		     0	  0	   0</p>
<p> RPR**			    240	  6	 113</p>
<p> UDF***			   203	  3	 102</p>
<p> Other right		     29	  2	  12</p>
<p> National Front		   0	  0	   1</p>
<p> Extreme-right		    0	  0	   0</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total			    566	 12	 416</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> VOTES			    votes won	  percentage</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		     634,984		2.52</p>
<p> Communists		     2,506,682		9.98</p>
<p> Socialists		     5,942,696	     23.67</p>
<p> PRS				  366,067		1.45</p>
<p> Other left			 635,192		2.53</p>
<p> Ecologists		     1,724,122		6.86</p>
<p> Independents		     335,336		1.33</p>
<p> RPR				3,914,417	     15.59</p>
<p> UDF				3,600,473	     14.34</p>
<p> Other right		    1,637,340		6.52</p>
<p> National Front		 3,782,427	     15.06</p>
<p> Extreme-right		     26,438		0.10</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Total electorate: 38.631.206 Turnout: 64.98 percent</p>
<p>*   Radical Socialist Party (centre-left)</p>
<p>**  Rally for the Republic (Gaullists, ruling coalition)</p>
<p>*** Union for French Democracy (centre-right, ruling coalition)</p>
